78	     * The owner's telephone in the same normalized form {@link OwnerIdentity} compares on:
79	     * the E.164 value via {@link OwnerTelephones#toE164}, falling back to the stored raw value
80	     * (or empty) when it cannot be normalized, so a stored value that predates the pipeline
81	     * still compares correctly.
